er border-slate-200 p-3\"><div class=\"px-2 pb-2 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Calculators</div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><a class=\"rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">LCA Calculator</a><a class=\"rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-3.5 text-center text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-emerald-500 transition-colors\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Calculator</a></div></div><a class=\"mt-2 rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/\">The Engine</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Calculator</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/guides\">LCA Guides</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><div class=\"mt-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-3\"><div class=\"px-2 pb-2 text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Popular learning guides</div><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-white\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator Guide</a><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-white\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-white\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block rounded-lg px-2 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-white\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a></div><a class=\"mt-2 rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"rounded-lg px-3 py-3 text-base font-bold text-slate-700 hover:text-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><div class=\"pt-5 mt-4 border-t border-slate-200\"><a class=\"block text-center bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white px-5 py-4 rounded-lg text-base font-bold shadow-md transition-all\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Launch LCA Workspace</a></div></div></div></details></div></div></nav></header><div class=\"flex-1\"><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-slate-50\"><section class=\"bg-slate-950 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-300\">Engineering knowledge base</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight\">Embodied Carbon &amp; Building LCA Guides</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300\">Practical, calculation-focused explanations that support the Green Engineering Tools LCA calculator. Each guide answers a different engineering question instead of repeating the same SEO text across multiple pages.</p><a class=\"mt-7 inline-flex rounded-lg bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-emerald-400\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open calculator</a></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/methodology\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Building LCA Methodology</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">How the calculation handles units, modules, replacements, transport and missing data.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">A practical guide to calculating construction material carbon from CSV or BIM quantities.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Product-stage GWP, declared units and fair EPD comparisons.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">EPD Carbon Calculator</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">How to read Environmental Product Declarations and use them in calculations.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">EC3 EPD Guide</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Search, correct BIM names, select EPDs and understand EC3&#x27;s role in LCA.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">BIM Embodied Carbon</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Revit and BIM schedule workflows, quantity QA and live synchronization.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Whole-Building LCA</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Scope, service life, lifecycle stages, impact categories and baseline comparison.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/module-d-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">Module D Explained</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Reuse and recycling beyond the system boundary without double counting.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-sm transition\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-950\">LEED Whole-Building LCA</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Version-aware guidance for LEED v4, v4.1 and v5.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-black text-emerald-700\">Read guide →</span></a></div><div class=\"mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 sm:p-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\">Suggested learning path</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-700 leading-7\">If you are new to embodied carbon, start with the calculator guide, then read A1-A3 and the EPD guide. If you work with Revit or material schedules, continue to the BIM and EC3 guides. For certification or whole-life studies, finish with the methodology, whole-building LCA, Module D and LEED guides.</p></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-400 border-t border-slate-800 w-full mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-9 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"w-7 h-7 text-emerald-500 mr-2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-black text-white tracking-tight\">GreenEngineering Tools</span></a><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Browser-based tools and practical guides for embodied carbon, EPD data, BIM material workflows and whole-building life-cycle assessment.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">Open LCA calculator →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/guides\">All Guides</a></nav></div><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Learn</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer learning navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/embodied-carbon-calculator\">Embodied Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/a1-a3-embodied-carbon\">A1-A3 Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/epd-carbon-calculator\">EPD Carbon Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/ec3-epd-guide\">EC3 EPD Guide</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">More Guides</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer additional guides\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/bim-embodied-carbon\">BIM Embodied Carbon</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/whole-building-lca\">Whole-Building LCA</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/module-d-lca\">Module D Explained</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/leed-whole-building-lca\">LEED Whole-Building LCA</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Company</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer company navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/terms\">Terms</a></nav></div></div><div class=\"mt-10 pt-7 border-t border-slate-800 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-between items-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 text-center md:text-left\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Green Engineering Tools. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500 text-center md:text-right\">Engineering decision-support tools for EN 15804-aligned lifecycle analysis and LEED whole-building LCA workflows. Formal certification and